{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本國梵音也"}
{"id": null, "n": "1279001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1279001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】唐代寫燉煌本大英博物館藏本尾缺，【甲】唐代寫燉煌本巴里國民圖書館藏本"}
{"id": null, "n": "1280001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1280001", "type": "orig", "text": "已下依甲本補之"}
